= Trust Recommendations =

You evasion tank or DPS — Utsusemi / Dual Wield. You need: healer (no self-cures), Haste, DPS.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Healer — NIN has zero self-cures, shadows drop, you need reliable backup</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Haste on melee (Dual Wield loves Haste), Refresh, Slow/Dispel on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March + Madrigal — NIN eats accuracy, boosts throwing weapon hit rate</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun interrupts — backup when your Utsusemi drops</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ayame">Ayame</a></strong></td><td>Self-sufficient SAM DPS, no overlap</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

